# Pairs with CutoverServesRestored. The restore returns without arming the
# previous copy's redirect, so a routing activation that cached the pre-cutover
# alias serves pre-restore data for as long as it never refreshes.
MODULE: CutoverServesRestoredNoRedirect
TARGET: CutoverServesRestored
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the cutover arms no redirect on the previous copy
PERTURBS: ArmRedirect

--- FIND
    /\ redir' = [redir EXCEPT !["prev"] = "shadow"]
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: no redirect.
    /\ UNCHANGED redir
--- END
